# The address the site is deployed at — no trailing slash needed.
# Used at build time for the canonical link, the social-card URLs, sitemap.xml and the structured data.
#
# The live address is already committed in `.env.production`, so production builds need nothing more.
# To build for a different address, set this in your host's dashboard (it overrides the file), or put it
# in a git-ignored `.env.production.local`.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://your-domain.com
